@startuml delivery_pipeline_review_loop
title reviewLoop: one review until clean, carried or stopped (review-loops spec 1.2.1)

legend top center
The reviewer is a fresh agent every round and never repairs.
Any agent that returns nothing also ends the loop as stopped.
A Keith ruling (keithRulings, passed when a stopped run is resumed) is "waiting"
until a repair round carries it out. Each ruling is carried out once.
end legend

start
:round = 0;
repeat
  :round = round + 1;
  :Fresh reviewer agent reviews the scope\n(round 2 on: reports every prior finding by id first;\npass 2 on: ids carry the pass, e.g. code-p2-1);
  :open = findings in state open\n(a critical or high finding marked waived counts as open,\nunless Keith's ruling on it was carried out);
  if (An open needsKeith finding\nhas no Keith ruling waiting?) then (yes)
    :Return stopped: needs Keith\n(diagram, Steps or code mismatch); <<#pink>>
    stop
  endif
  if (No open findings?) then (yes)
    :Return clean\n(waivers listed for the ledger); <<#palegreen>>
    stop
  endif
  if (A finding still open after 2 repair rounds?) then (yes)
    :Return stopped (CLAUDE.md section 18); <<#pink>>
    stop
  endif
  if (round >= maxRounds\n(3 for a small item, else 5)?) then (yes)
    if (A medium, high or critical finding\nhas no Keith ruling waiting?) then (yes)
      :Return stopped: round cap; <<#pink>>
      stop
    elseif (No Keith ruling waiting?) then (yes)
      :Return carried: the open low findings go to\nthe ledger as open items for Keith; <<#palegreen>>
      stop
    else (a ruling is waiting)
      :Go on past the cap: this repair round\ncarries out the ruling, one more review follows;
    endif
  endif
  :Builder agent repairs each open finding, proposes a waiver,\nor escalates; it carries out each waiting Keith ruling exactly;
  if (Escalated, or a waiver proposed for a critical\nor high finding Keith did not rule on?) then (yes)
    :Return stopped: goes to Keith\n(this round's repairs are not re-tested or reviewed;\na resume with Keith's ruling reruns this repair round); <<#pink>>
    stop
  endif
  :Mark this round's Keith rulings carried out;\ncount one repair round for each open finding;
  if (This review re-runs tests?) then (yes)
    :Fresh agent re-runs static analysis and unit tests\n(re-captures screenshots when hasUi);
  endif
repeat while (next round)
@enduml
